    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339720/extras/bec8421f3e707ab69da88ad1d39dd7a5.poster.avif?t=1740787745\" width=520 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339720/extras/bec8421f3e707ab69da88ad1d39dd7a5.webm?t=1740787745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339720/extras/bec8421f3e707ab69da88ad1d39dd7a5.mp4?t=1740787745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quirky Forest</strong> is a <strong>fast-paced single player puzzle platformer</strong>. Help two inseparable friends to explore this wacky forest. Place the correct item at the right place, plan ahead, think carefully, <strong>this game is easy to play, but hard to master</strong>. Be prepared to be challenged!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A big inspiration for the design of this game is <strong>Nintendo</strong>. I believe if you truly enjoyed titles as <strong>Toad Treasure Tracker, Super Mario 3D World</strong>, <strong>this game is totally for you</strong>, thank you so much for checking it out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The full game will contain:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >35 Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy story about two inseparable friends\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Different mind-boggling mechanics</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339720/extras/bec8421f3e707ab69da88ad1d39dd7a5.poster.avif?t=1740787745\" width=520 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339720/extras/bec8421f3e707ab69da88ad1d39dd7a5.webm?t=1740787745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339720/extras/bec8421f3e707ab69da88ad1d39dd7a5.mp4?t=1740787745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quirky Forest</strong> is a <strong>fast-paced single player puzzle platformer</strong>. Help two inseparable friends to explore this wacky forest. Place the correct item at the right place, plan ahead, think carefully, <strong>this game is easy to play, but hard to master</strong>. Be prepared to be challenged!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A big inspiration for the design of this game is <strong>Nintendo</strong>. I believe if you truly enjoyed titles as <strong>Toad Treasure Tracker, Super Mario 3D World</strong>, <strong>this game is totally for you</strong>, thank you so much for checking it out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The full game will contain:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >35 Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy story about two inseparable friends\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Different mind-boggling mechanics</p></li></ul>",
